' v1.2's keys at play (`preset classic|extended ai none seed 3 start 30`, Paradise
' Camp). On the world map: T tapped does nothing; T held 0.7 s ends the turn
' (`NEXT_TURN_HOLD_TIME`, 0.6 s); C switches to the info cursor and back. In
' the place: C is fight mode and C again speak mode; R opens INFO and the map
' button closes it; H the statistics; V the world map; there, O the options.
' Each key that runs a menu command logs `key: <action> -> <command>`.
press escape             ' Back closes the manual v1.2 opens on a new game's first world map (MapScene.cs:687-691)
holdkey t 100            ' a tap: nothing
wait 30
holdkey t 700            ' held: the turn ends
wait 60
press c                  ' info mode
press c                  ' travel mode
mapclick 110,122         ' into Paradise Camp
wait 60
press c                  ' fight mode
press c                  ' speak mode
press r                  ' INFO
wait 5
sceneclick 20,185        ' back
wait 5
press h                  ' statistics
wait 5
sceneclick 100,100
wait 5
press v                  ' the world map
wait 10
press o                  ' options, from the world map
wait 5
quit
